sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Device
    participant G as Gateway
    participant C as Cloud
    D->>G: reading (plaintext)
    Note over G: validate, update sensor state
    Note over G: encapsulate(public key)<br/>→ shared secret + KEM ciphertext
    Note over G: AES-256-GCM encrypt<br/>reading + timestamp
    G->>C: kem_ciphertext, nonce, ciphertext
    Note over C: decapsulate(private key)<br/>→ same shared secret
    Note over C: decrypt, check timestamp,<br/>validate, store in SQLite
    C-->>G: 200 stored
    G-->>D: 200 forwarded
